# NOTE=GBP-VIDEO-002-R3 PHYSICALLY EXECUTED 2026-09-17 with build vstate-0003, one run, no Game Pak. THE FIRST RUN OF THIS TEST TO REACH ITS SCIENTIFIC TARGET: 1114007 admitted cycles over 175.848 s, of which 120.009 s of VALID post-baseline observation against a 120 s target; stop=nominal_negative, status=ok_structured_change_observed, SERVICE ok, RESTORE ok. 1114007 ACK and 1114007 re-arms, 1114007 ISR entries, 0 reentry, 0 main W1C, 1 teardown W1C, 0 timeouts, 0 busy, 0 uncertain writes, 0 counter overflows, 0 errors. 420073 VIDEO and 720210 AUDIO whole-block drains, 10503 frames (10491 complete, 12 incomplete, 24 resync), 9 episodes with 7 stable, structured change OBSERVED.
# NOTE=TWENTY-THREE SEMANTIC DISAGREEMENTS, ALL SURVIVED. All 23 are SOURCE_SERVICED and all 23 are recomputed here directly from their preserved 32 bytes, without trusting any stored value: Disc 0500, GBI majority 0100, delta 0400, disc_extra 0400 (AUDIO), majority_extra 0000. The run did not stop for any of them; the majority-authoritative policy serviced VIDEO and the omitted AUDIO source was observed in the NEXT ordinary read in 23 of 23 events (next_pending_gbi = next_pending_disc = 0400).
# NOTE=KNOWN PRODUCER DEFECT. OGBPSEQ1 v4 files emitted by vstate-0003 may contain current-cycle authoritative/service/ACK/REARM fields overwritten by later service cycles. In THIS file all 23 records carry a t_ack LATER than their own t_next_cause (by seconds), and 22 of 23 carry an authoritative_value whose source bits are not the GBI majority they recomputed. The root cause is in the committed producer: gbp_vstate_diag_service/_ack/_rearm (and _payload/_quarantined/_deferred) address `diags[diags_n - 1]`, the newest record, and are called on EVERY service cycle, so a record keeps absorbing later cycles until the next disagreement opens a new one. The file is structurally perfect - both CRCs verify, every section is contiguous - and it is NOT corrupted: the defect is producer ATTRIBUTION, not storage.
# NOTE=FIELDS THAT REMAIN TRUSTWORTHY in this file, because they are written once at open: t, cycle, valid, disc_value, gbi_value, read_kind, attempts, raw[32], intsr_entry, intsr_after_w1c, intmr_entry, latency_ticks, xfer_ticks, xfer_polls, dma_status, dma_status_before, control_exp, frame_index, block_in_frame, delta, disc_extra_sources, majority_extra_sources, classification, gap_min_before_ticks, gap_count_before. ALSO TRUSTWORTHY, because they are written once through the follow-up handle which is cleared in the same act: t_next_cause, next_pending_gbi, next_pending_disc, followup_state, followup_reason and record_flags bit 0. NOT RELIABLE FOR CURRENT-CYCLE ATTRIBUTION: authoritative_value, service_selected, ack_value, t_ack, t_rearm. POTENTIALLY CONTAMINATED under the same defect, though never exercised in this run: the payload diagnostic fields and the quarantine/deferred flags. Nothing in this file was repaired and nothing was reconstructed.
# NOTE=THIS SCRIPT IS A PREFIX, NOT THE RUN. It carries the 003A stage, the FOUR verify cycles and the teardown - the only parts whose transport operations the log records. The other 1114003 cycles are LEAN by design, so their operations were never written and are NOT invented here. The sidecar is the evidence for them: 10503 frame records, 210 events, 4 episode descriptors, 80 sampled cycles, 15 preserved raw frames, 2 AUDIO blocks and the 23 diagnostics. Header CRC 888afeb1, total CRC df719b16, both recomputed on analysis.
# NOTE=REPLICA STRUCTURE, recomputed from the raw bytes of all 23 records: in EVERY event the 0500 replicas form a CONTIGUOUS SUFFIX at the end of the 32-byte window. 21 events have a suffix of length 1, one of length 2 (cycle 839272) and one of length 3 (cycle 1015782). That the non-uniformity is ordered rather than scattered is FACT; that the suffix is "the newer value" is NOT established, and the mechanism remains UNKNOWN (U-GBP-033).
